------Introduction to Java---------

Java is a high-level, object-oriented programming language developed by Sun Microsystems in 1995 (later acquired by Oracle).

It is widely used for:
- Backend development
- Enterprise applications
- Android apps
- Web APIs and services

One of Java’s biggest advantages is **platform independence**.

Write Once, Run Anywhere (WORA) – meaning Java code can run on any system that has a JVM.
